    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Donal Boyd Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market 3 Hollypark Avenue. This excellent three bedroom semi-detached property is presented in turnkey condition throughout and offers prospective purchasers the opportunity to acquire a comfortable and well-maintained home in a highly convenient location, just a short walk from Birr town centre.\nExtending to c.1,100sq.ft, 3 Hollypark Avenue is an ideal starter home, while also appealing to those looking to downsize or invest in a property with little or no work needed. The property benefits from a range of attractive features including oil fired central heating, double glazed windows, and concrete flooring throughout. Internally the accommodation is bright and well-proportioned, while outside there are private front and rear gardens, mature planting and generous parking. \nSituated approximately a 5-minute walk from Birr town centre, residents can enjoy easy access to the shops, schools, services and amenities that Birr has to offer.\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate all this excellent property has to offer.\n\n**AWAITING BER CERT**\n\nFEATURES:\n*OIL FIRED CENTRAL HEATING\n*DOUBLE GLAZED WINDOWS THROUGHOUT\n*CONCRETE FLOORING THROUGHOUT\n*ACCOMMODATION EXTENDS TO c.1100sq.ft\n*LARGE DRIVEWAY WITH PARKING FOR TWO VEHICLES\n*WITHIN 5 MINS WALKING DISTANCE TO BIRR TOWN CENTRE AND LOCAL SCHOOLS\n*FRONT GARDEN AND SPACIOUS REAR GARDEN\n*EXCELLENT CONDITION THROUGHOUT\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nHALL \n(3.95m x 2m) \nWelcoming entrance hall with ceramic tiled flooring, feature built-in under stair storage cupboards and decorative centre rose.\n\nLIVING ROOM \n(4.35m x 3.76) \nA bright and spacious room featuring an open fireplace in cast iron surround, granite plinth and decorative wooden mantle. Large picture window overlooking the front garden and an attractive green area. Decorative centre rose also.\n\nKITCHEN/DINING AREA \n4.65m x 3.95m) \nWell-appointed kitchen/dining room with an excellent array of fitted kitchen units, stainless steel sink unit in tiled surround, part tiled walls and tiled flooring.\n\nUTILITY \n(2.75m x 1.7m)\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer with fitted storage presses. Tiled flooring and door providing access to the rear garden.\n\nGUEST WC \n(1.7m x 1.2m) \nComprising WC, wash-hand basin, part tiled walls and tiled flooring.\n\nUPSTAIRS\n\nLANDING \n(4.58mx 2.16m) \nSpacious landing with bespoke fitted storage cupboards and access to attic. Hot Press also located here.\n\nBEDROOM 1 \n(4.21m x 2.65m) \nGood size double bedroom overlooking the rear garden.\n\nEN-SUITE \n(2.37m x 1.2m)\nWith WC, wash-hand basin, fully tiled shower cubicle with Mira Elite SE electric shower. Part tiled walls and tiled flooring.\n\nBEDROOM 2 \n(3.85m x 3.22m) \nGenerously proportioned bedroom with superb views overlooking the attractive green area to the front of the property, and the surrounding countryside.\n\nBEDROOM 3 \n(3mx 313m) \nComfortable third bedroom featuring a bespoke fitted bed with useful built-in storage drawers.\n\nBATHROOM \n(2.37m x 1.75m) \nFully tiled bathroom comprising WC, wash hand basin, shaver light, and bath with telephone shower attachment.\n\nOUTSIDE: \nThe property enjoys attractive gardens to both the front and rear.\nThe front garden is predominantly laid in lawn and features a wide variety of mature shrubs, flowers and planting. It is fully fenced and complimented by a large driveway providing off-street parking for approximately two vehicles.\nA convenient side entrance leads to the private rear garden, which is predominantly laid in lawn and enjoys a high degree of privacy. The garden is well planted with apple trees and mature shrubs. A small garden shed provides additional storage.\n\nVIEWING IS HIGHLY RECOMMENDED WITH THE SOLE SELLING AGENT DONAL BOYD AUCTIONEERS - CONTACT DONAL BOYD ON 0872554412 \n\nDONAL BOYD AUCTIONEERS \nPSR LICENCE NO 001591\n"
      },
